  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers OASIS SAML 2.0 for single sign-on: assertions, the request and response protocols, the HTTP-Redirect, HTTP-POST and HTTP-Artifact bindings, the Web Browser SSO and Single Logout profiles, metadata, and the secure validation of responses. SAML 2.0 is current, pinned to the 15 March 2005 OASIS Standard with Approved Errata 05 (1 May 2012); SAML 1.1 is legacy, with an upgrade path to 2.0. XML Signature 1.1, Exclusive XML Canonicalization and the XML Signature Best Practices are dependency sources. References are split into versions, assertions and protocol, bindings and profiles, metadata, and the response validation checklist.",
